WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
The three eyes are of barbarian blood

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,760
Her body is so weak

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,440
It's because there's still half of it covered in blood and soil

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:05,760
Three eyes have not been opened

5
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,440
It will only continue to consume her life

6
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,360
Unless you practice

7
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,640
Or there is a strong person who has the temperament

8
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:11,280
Then use barbarian elixirs to maintain

9
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,680
She can live till now

10
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:14,000
It's already a miracle

11
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,130
so many years

12
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,810
How did she survive it?

13
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:45,740
No one will sell you three pills for twenty taels.

14
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:47,950
That's not okay

15
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:50,940
I owe you a few days

16
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,180
Lend me your life

17
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,820
Can I pay you back in a few days?

18
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,020
Can last for twenty days

19
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:58,490
Still the same sentence

20
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:00,690
When did you run out of money?

21
00:01:00,690 --> 00:01:02,450
I'll sleep with the old lady one night

22
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:06,250
I'll give you three pieces of earth for free

23
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:07,970
Come back when you have time
